      "",
      "“Hello, Little Liang. Are you very busy today?”",
      "",
      "“Yes, I am very busy today. There are lots of people today.”",
      "",
      "“Does this little dog have a name now?” Qian Duoduo asked.",
      "",
      "“No. You really like her, right? How about you give her a name?”",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo thought about it and said, “Call … call her ‘Cola’. How about that?”"
